Aurora control bridge (forge patch; upstream has no automation API).

With AURORA_CONTROL_DIR set, the viewer creates that directory (0700) and
answers JSON-line requests on control.sock through its own action paths,
so RLVa and native permissions apply. Unset, nothing changes.
See docs/aurora-viewer.md and tools/aurora-control.

